# Your Platform — Full Concept

You are building a **new kind of software-development platform** where people can create complete, functional applications **without writing traditional code**.

The user doesn't start with a blank code editor.

They start with a **visual idea**.

They can upload a screenshot, mockup, drawing, or photo of what they want their application to look like. Your system interprets that visual input, converts it into your own programming language, creates the required application structure and backend, and then executes it inside your own platform.

The user can then **interact with the generated application and modify it visually**, almost like editing a video.

